            "start_line": 26,
            "end_line": 28,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// INSTANCE is the shared singleton with size=0; at construction its position==size, // so skipping 0 bytes still hits EOF and returns -1 (throwEofException is false on INSTANCE) long skipResultOnInstance = oneByteStream.INSTANCE.skip(0L);"
          },
